# Inverting opamp amplifier (gain = -R2/R1). Exercises the opamp symbol
# (inverting input top, non-inverting bottom), a feedback loop routed
# over the body, and a grounded reference input.
circuit Inverting amplifier

label 1 4.3 Vin
wire 1.5 5  3 5
resistor 6 5 h R1 10k
wire 9 5  11 5
dot 10 5

# feedback: R2 from the inverting input over the top to the output
wire 10 5  10 1  11 1
resistor 14 1 h R2 100k
wire 17 1  18 1  18 6
dot 18 6

opamp 14 6 h U1
wire 11 7  10 7  10 9
gnd 10 9

wire 17 6  21 6
label 21.5 6.3 Vout
